<div id=3D"outline-container-orga3d982c" class=3D"outline-3">
<h3 id=3D"orga3d982c">Mikhail announced</h3>
<div class=3D"outline-text-3" id=3D"text-orga3d982c">
<p>
Yo!=20
</p>

<p>
I am  happy to announce the first release of <a href=3D"https://github.com/=
dx3mod/ozstd"><b>ozstd</b></a> library! The is a small, modern OCaml bindin=
g to <a href=3D"https://github.com/facebook/zstd">Zstandard</a>. It wraps t=
he common one-shot and streaming C APIs in a simple, idiomatic interface.
</p>


<div id=3D"org58d9026" class=3D"figure">
<p><img src=3D"https://i.ibb.co/LXfsM8S3/logos-001-2.png" alt=3D"logos-001-=
2.png" width=3D"200" />
