<p>
Hi everyone,
</p>

<p>
I'm happy to announce the release of a new version of <a href=3D"https://gi=
thub.com/tarides/opam-monorepo">opam-monorepo</a>, a tool to assemble monor=
epos of your projects dependencies to compile them at once with <code>dune<=
