<h2 id=3D"11">melange-json is now jsonkit</h2>
<div class=3D"outline-text-2" id=3D"text-11">
<p>
Archive: <a href=3D"https://discuss.ocaml.org/t/ann-melange-json-is-now-jso=
nkit/18550/1">https://discuss.ocaml.org/t/ann-melange-json-is-now-jsonkit/1=
8550/1</a>
</p>
</div>
<div id=3D"outline-container-org43f3b43" class=3D"outline-3">
<h3 id=3D"org43f3b43">Pedro Braga announced</h3>
<div class=3D"outline-text-3" id=3D"text-org43f3b43">
<p>
Hey there!
</p>

<p>
A while ago, we moved <a href=3D"https://github.com/ahrefs/ppx_deriving_jso=
nschema">ppx_deriving_jsonschema</a> into the <code>melange-json</code> pro=
ject, so one PPX now provides both json decoding/encoding and jsonschema to=
ols. At that point, <code>melange-json</code> no longer described it well, =
so we renamed <code>melange-json</code> to <b><a href=3D"https://github.com=
/melange-community/jsonkit"><code>jsonkit</code></a></b> as a project that =
provides OCaml json tooling. It works exactly like <code>melange-json</code=
> used to, but you can also handle jsonschema with the same ppx:
</p>

<div class=3D"org-src-container">
<pre class=3D"src src-ocaml"><code><span style=3D"color: #242521; font-weig=
ht: bold;">open </span><span style=3D"color: #557400; font-weight: bold;">J=
sonkit.Primitives</span>

<span style=3D"color: #242521; font-weight: bold;">type</span> <span style=
=3D"color: #444fcf; font-weight: bold;">user</span> =3D { name : string; ag=
e : int } <span style=3D"color: #a7601f;">[@@deriving json, jsonschema]</sp=
an>

<span style=3D"color: #242521; font-weight: bold;">let</span> <span style=
=3D"color: #007a9f;">schema</span> =3D <span style=3D"color: #557400; font-=
weight: bold;">Jsonkit.Jsonschema.</span>make user_jsonschema
</code></pre>
</div>
<p>
New package names:
</p>

<table border=3D"2" cellspacing=3D"0" cellpadding=3D"6" rules=3D"groups" fr=
ame=3D"hsides">


<colgroup>
<col  class=3D"org-left" />

<col  class=3D"org-left" />
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th scope=3D"col" class=3D"org-left">before</th>
<th scope=3D"col" class=3D"org-left">after</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class=3D"org-left"><code>melange-json</code> / <code>melange-json.ppx</=
code></td>
<td class=3D"org-left"><code>jsonkit-melange</code> / <code>jsonkit-melange=
.ppx</code></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td class=3D"org-left"><code>melange-json-native</code> / <code>melange-jso=
n-native.ppx</code></td>
<td class=3D"org-left"><code>jsonkit</code> / <code>jsonkit.ppx</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<p>
See the <a href=3D"https://github.com/melange-community/jsonkit/blob/main/C=
HANGES.md#jsonkit100-2026-07-30">changelog</a> for what changed since the m=
igration.
</p>
